,{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp49dyng041esljxprl8e1qm","title":"Runway Agent","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp49dyng041esljxprl8e1qm","https://app.runwayml.com/agent"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp49dyng041esljxprl8e1qm","title":"Runway Agent","originalTitle":"","summary":"Runway Agent 是一个集成化创意工具平台，旨在为用户提供实现任何创意所需的全套资源与功能。该平台整合了视频编辑、图像生成、3D建模等多种人工智能驱动工具，允许用户在一个工作流中无缝完成从概念到成品的创作过程。其核心特点是降低了专业内容制作的技术门槛，通过自动化与智能辅助功能，让用户能够更自由地将想法转化为视觉作品。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp49dyng041esljxprl8e1qm","originalUrl":"https://app.runwayml.com/agent","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-94ug1h","originalSourceName":"Runway：Changelog（网页）","family":"outlet-1iwoido","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp49dyng041esljxprl8e1qm","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-94ug1h","name":"Runway：Changelog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"Runway Agent 是一个集成化创意工具平台，旨在为用户提供实现任何创意所需的全套资源与功能。该平台整合了视频编辑、图像生成、3D建模等多种人工智能驱动工具，允许用户在一个工作流中无缝完成从概念到成品的创作过程。其核心特点是降低了专业内容制作的技术门槛，通过自动化与智能辅助功能，让用户能够更自由地将想法转化为视觉作品。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp3kla5p06u9sl1qoxp8zb9o","title":"消息称 Anthropic 正就以超 9000 亿美元投前估值筹集至少 300 亿美元谈判","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp3kla5p06u9sl1qoxp8zb9o","https://www.ithome.com/0/949/715.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp3kla5p06u9sl1qoxp8zb9o","title":"消息称 Anthropic 正就以超 9000 亿美元投前估值筹集至少 300 亿美元谈判","originalTitle":"","summary":"据报道，AI公司Anthropic正就新一轮融资进行初步谈判，目标是以超过9000亿美元的投前估值筹集至少300亿美元资金。这有望成为该公司迄今最大规模的融资轮次，交易最快可能在本月底完成。此前，Anthropic在今年2月完成了300亿美元的G轮融资，投后估值为3800亿美元，并从谷歌和亚马逊获得了150亿美元的投资承诺。为应对高昂的算力成本，公司计划于今年晚些时候进行首次公开募股（IPO）。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp3kla5p06u9sl1qoxp8zb9o","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/949/715.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp3kla5p06u9sl1qoxp8zb9o","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"据报道，AI公司Anthropic正就新一轮融资进行初步谈判，目标是以超过9000亿美元的投前估值筹集至少300亿美元资金。这有望成为该公司迄今最大规模的融资轮次，交易最快可能在本月底完成。此前，Anthropic在今年2月完成了300亿美元的G轮融资，投后估值为3800亿美元，并从谷歌和亚马逊获得了150亿美元的投资承诺。为应对高昂的算力成本，公司计划于今年晚些时候进行首次公开募股（IPO）。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4eqy8u059osljxs6c4bk0v","title":"Anthropic 首次在 B2B 采用率上超越 OpenAI，Ramp 支出数据显示","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp4eqy8u059osljxs6c4bk0v","https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-overtakes-openai-in-b2b-adoption-for-the-first-time-according-to-ramp-spending-data"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp4eqy8u059osljxs6c4bk0v","title":"Anthropic 首次在 B2B 采用率上超越 OpenAI，Ramp 支出数据显示","originalTitle":"","summary":"根据 Ramp AI 指数数据，Anthropic 在美国企业客户中的采用率达到 34.4%，首次超越 OpenAI 的 32.3%。其业务覆盖范围在一年内增长了四倍。但文章指出，三个因素可能使其领先优势迅速减弱。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4eqy8u059osljxs6c4bk0v","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-overtakes-openai-in-b2b-adoption-for-the-first-time-according-to-ramp-spending-data","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4eqy8u059osljxs6c4bk0v","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"根据 Ramp AI 指数数据，Anthropic 在美国企业客户中的采用率达到 34.4%，首次超越 OpenAI 的 32.3%。其业务覆盖范围在一年内增长了四倍。但文章指出，三个因素可能使其领先优势迅速减弱。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp46yq7n03icsljxf67um76u","title":"Kling AI将亮相2026戛纳探讨AI电影制作","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp46yq7n03icsljxf67um76u","https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2054577409064911330"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp46yq7n03icsljxf67um76u","title":"Kling AI将亮相2026戛纳探讨AI电影制作","originalTitle":"","summary":"Kling AI将于2026年5月18日在戛纳电影节电影市场会议中举办专场活动，主题为“从创意可能到制作现实：Kling AI在电影工作流中的应用”。活动旨在探讨AI辅助电影制作的现状与未来演进。Kling AI通过支持《House of David》、《Born of the Tide》及《RAPHAEL》等项目，展示了AI在好莱坞级制作、全AI生成动画及剧情长片等实际影视生产中的多元化应用。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp46yq7n03icsljxf67um76u","originalUrl":"https://x.com/Kling_ai/status/2054577409064911330","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-w6r54g","originalSourceName":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","family":"outlet-1n05q4z","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp46yq7n03icsljxf67um76u","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-w6r54g","name":"X：可灵 Kling AI (@Kling_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Kling AI将于2026年5月18日在戛纳电影节电影市场会议中举办专场活动，主题为“从创意可能到制作现实：Kling AI在电影工作流中的应用”。活动旨在探讨AI辅助电影制作的现状与未来演进。Kling AI通过支持《House of David》、《Born of the Tide》及《RAPHAEL》等项目，展示了AI在好莱坞级制作、全AI生成动画及剧情长片等实际影视生产中的多元化应用。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4j0582068osljxjmrn48ll","title":"ExploitGym：AI智能体能否将安全漏洞转化为真实攻击？","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp4j0582068osljxjmrn48ll","https://rdi.berkeley.edu/blog/exploitgym"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp4j0582068osljxjmrn48ll","title":"ExploitGym：AI智能体能否将安全漏洞转化为真实攻击？","originalTitle":"","summary":"由伯克利RDI、马克斯·普朗克安全与隐私研究所、Anthropic、OpenAI及谷歌等机构研究人员组成的团队，发布了名为ExploitGym的新基准测试。该测试包含898个真实漏洞，要求AI智能体根据漏洞描述生成完整的漏洞利用程序。结果显示，前沿AI模型已能成功利用相当数量的漏洞，即使在启用ASLR等标准防御措施后，部分攻击仍能成功。这证明AI已具备自主将漏洞转化为实际攻击的能力，该技术具有双重用途：既可帮助防御者评估漏洞严重性，也可能降低攻击者的技术门槛。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4j0582068osljxjmrn48ll","originalUrl":"https://rdi.berkeley.edu/blog/exploitgym","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-ogmiie","originalSourceName":"Berkeley RDI：Blog（AI 安全与评测）","family":"outlet-1mt9j8s","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4j0582068osljxjmrn48ll","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-ogmiie","name":"Berkeley RDI：Blog（AI 安全与评测）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"由伯克利RDI、马克斯·普朗克安全与隐私研究所、Anthropic、OpenAI及谷歌等机构研究人员组成的团队，发布了名为ExploitGym的新基准测试。该测试包含898个真实漏洞，要求AI智能体根据漏洞描述生成完整的漏洞利用程序。结果显示，前沿AI模型已能成功利用相当数量的漏洞，即使在启用ASLR等标准防御措施后，部分攻击仍能成功。这证明AI已具备自主将漏洞转化为实际攻击的能力，该技术具有双重用途：既可帮助防御者评估漏洞严重性，也可能降低攻击者的技术门槛。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4geh6305mdsljxeaow8it6","title":"Claude 电脑与浏览器使用的最佳实践","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp4geh6305mdsljxeaow8it6","https://claude.com/blog/best-practices-for-computer-and-browser-use-with-claude"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp4geh6305mdsljxeaow8it6","title":"Claude 电脑与浏览器使用的最佳实践","originalTitle":"","summary":"Claude 最新模型在电脑与浏览器使用能力上显著提升，支持构建复杂智能体系统。本文针对Claude 4.6系列和Opus 4.7提供实践指南，重点优化截图分辨率：Claude 4.6系列API限制最大长边1568像素、总像素115万；Opus 4.7提升至最大长边2576像素、总像素375万。发送前将截图缩放到限制内是提升点击准确性的最有效方法。推荐起始分辨率为1280x720，Opus 4.7用户可优先使用1080p，并避免发送未经缩放的原始截图或过低分辨率图像。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4geh6305mdsljxeaow8it6","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/best-practices-for-computer-and-browser-use-with-claude","publishedAt":"2026-05-14T00:00:38.741Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp4geh6305mdsljxeaow8it6","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T08:48:59.093Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Claude 最新模型在电脑与浏览器使用能力上显著提升，支持构建复杂智能体系统。本文针对Claude 4.6系列和Opus 4.7提供实践指南，重点优化截图分辨率：Claude 4.6系列API限制最大长边1568像素、总像素115万；Opus 4.7提升至最大长边2576像素、总像素375万。发送前将截图缩放到限制内是提升点击准确性的最有效方法。推荐起始分辨率为1280x720，Opus 4.7用户可优先使用1080p，并避免发送未经缩放的原始截图或过低分辨率图像。","reportEdition":"2026-05-14","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":14,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":1